        "text": "8"
      }
    ],
    "correct_option": "B",
    "explanation": {
      "simple": "Check if 899 is divisible by 29: 899 = 29 * 31 (yes). Simply divide old remainder 63 by 29: 63 = 29 * 2 + 5 -> Remainder = 5.",
