        "text": "7,600"
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "7,650"
      }
    ],
    "correct_option": "A",
    "explanation": {
      "simple": "AP: 101, 103, ..., 199. Number of terms = (199 - 101)/2 + 1 = 50. Sum = n/2 * (First + Last) = 50/2 * (101 + 199) = 25 * 300 = 7,500.",
